   - Enrichment, and functional scoring: over-representation analysis, [GSEA](https://www.gsea-msigdb.org/gsea/index.jsp) analysis, [GSVA](https://github.com/rcastelo/GSVA), [AUCell](https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/AUCell.html), [UCell](https://github.com/carmonalab/UCell), metabolic pathway activity inference via [scMetabolism](https://github.com/wu-yc/scMetabolism), and metabolic flux estimation via [scFEA](https://github.com/changwn/scFEA).
